  "notes": [
    "HeadTTS phonemises with its CMUdict-derived American dictionary (BSD), so voices are American for now; no eSpeak or other GPL component is used.",
    "npm ci installs HeadTTS's dependencies from its committed lockfile (integrity hashes); install scripts are not run.",
    "The server is bound to loopback and only the API calls it; the model is loaded from the verified local files with remote downloads disabled.",
    "WebGPU (Metal) is about 30% faster than CPU per sentence; synthesis shares the API's generation slot, so it never runs while Qwen generates.",
    "Voices extended to all 19 usable American Kokoro voices (11 female, 8 male; am_santa excluded as a novelty voice) on 2026-10-14, so each running order can give its 16 characters different voices. Quality varies between voices."
  ]
